00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:49.220
Are they stupid? To try to challenge Saigo-san.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.770
Show them your strength, Saigo-san.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.630
Beat the crap out of them.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:59.270
Th... This is...

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.100
Hey, do you know where Fuuunji high school is?

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.070
I think I came to the wrong place.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:15.900
What do you want with our school?

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.870
So it's your school.

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.110
Are you Inuzuka Koushi by any chance?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:23.460
Huh?

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.710
What's with this guy?

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:28.660
I never thought anyone would mistake Saigo-san for Inuzuka.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:32.870
My bad. In a closer look, this guy doesn't look that strong after all.

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:33.780
I'm terribly sorry.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.820
Saigo-san is getting serious.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.570
Huh? Fine.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.720
Don't bore me.

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:45.940
Eh?

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.040
Sa... Saigo-san!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:57.160
How about bringing me to where Inuzuka Koushi is.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:02.090
The Assassin From the Tiger Clan, Appears!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.290
Uh... Koushi-dono...

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.940
Pl... Please cheer up...

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.450
You left without me.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:23.240
You forgot about me and left without me.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.670
I'm so very terribly sorry!

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:28.670
I'll accept any punishment!

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.230
Please use this to your heart's content!

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.990
Koushi-dono, please, please forgive me...

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.180
Koushi-dono...

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:48.320
Koushi-dono!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.900
Koushi-dono!

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.120
Koushi-dono~!

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.130
Study, study.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:56.860
I'm gonna become a prosecutor.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.330
I can't allow her to interrupt my study.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:03.110
May I sit beside you?

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:05.860
Cla... Class rep.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:08.010
Beside me?

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:09.590
Sure, I don't mind.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.900
Thank you.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:16.630
Speaking of which, Inuzuka-kun got the highest mark on the last exam again.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:19.860
Aren't you better at literature than I am?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.880
But my politics is terrible.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:23.930
This is it!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.720
I've always wanted to have mature conversations like this.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.200
He... He should be here...

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.120
What are they doing?

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:34.090
It's him! That guy is Inuzuka Koushi!

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:35.600
Really.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.850
I've been looking for you, Inuzuka Koushi.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.410
Western Branch Shindara Rettetsu Style
Koganei Tenka

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:52.580
I'm Koganei Tenka of the Shindara Rettetsu style.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.020
I'm here to rip you apart!

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.470
No way, another assassin?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.070
St... Stop the violence!

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:06.090
Outsiders are prohibited to enter the school. I'll call the police!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.070
Inuzuka-kun, you can't fight against someone like him!

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:10.800
Out of the way, woman!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.910
Inuzuka Koushi is gonna duel with me!

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:15.170
I don't fight with people.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.050
What did you say!?

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.650
I said I don't fight.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.380
I don't do martial arts.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:24.130
I don't have the slightest intention to get involved with you guys.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.080
Please leave, if you understand what I mean.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.400
I'm sick of you, Inuzuka Koushi.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.680
Hiding behind a woman, and having no will to fight.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.840
I won't feel satisfied even if I win.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:42.570
I'm leaving.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.770
Koushi-dono!

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.130
Koushi-dono!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.100
I'm really sorry.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:54.620
Momoko!

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.310
Aren't you Momoko!?

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:58.950
Eh? How do you know my name?

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.280
You are Momoko after all!

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.200
Ho... How are you, Momoko?

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:06.400
It's been a while.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:07.720
I wanted to see you!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:08.360
Kya~

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:11.410
By the way, what happened while we were apart?

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.030
You know... Like...

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.290
Yo... Yo... You... You... You...

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.280
You become prettier.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:20.290
Yay! I said it!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.040
Eh... Who are you?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.680
No... No way!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.220
Momoko, you forgot? This can't be! Please remember.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:32.230
About me, and about that day!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.280
About... that day?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:36.480
That's right!

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:40.960
We made a promise on the day we parted, on this soccer ball!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.600
Good bye.
The next time we meet,
let's ke...

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.600
Tenka
Momoko

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.630
About our future!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.100
No... No way!

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.850
Momoko, you remember now!?

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.520
I... I... I...

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.700
I don't remember a thing.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.990
Hmm... What does that "ke" mean?

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.990
Note: "Ke" can be "kekkon", which means "to marry". "Kettan", which means "bloody phlegm". And of course, "kecchapu", which means "ketchup".

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.590
What? You know him?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.770
No, a total stranger.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:12.770
Ko... Koushi-dono... I'm really sorry about what happened the other day...

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.760
Forget about it, do as you please.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.510
Thank you so much, Koushi-dono!

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:25.270
Thank you so much!

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.270
Stop it, let go!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.790
They finally cut them off...

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.860
Gas and running water...

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:32.990
Bear with it.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:38.300
Though we've given up on assassinating Inuzuka Koushi, but we still need to resurrect the Miyamoto group.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.860
Even if I have to risk my life!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.720
That's my promise with Momoko-dono.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.450
Si... Sis...

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.480
Sorry that I sounded like a wimp.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.930
Let's work for it together!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:50.910
Sis!

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:51.470
Let's go.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:52.220
Huh?

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:56.210
Inuzuka Koushi's strength is essential to the resurrection of the Miyamoto group.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:57.720
What are you talking about?

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:02.690
To accelerate our pace towards the resurrection of our group, further investigation is required!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.530
About onii-chan...

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.090
Did you just say "onii-chan"?

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:10.260
Could it be that you just want to see him?

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.290
What are you saying!?

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.750
It's for the sake of our objective and our future!

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.260
Don't misunderstand!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.760
Yeah, sure.

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.010
It can't be!

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.270
It can't be, it can't be, it can't be!!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:25.050
How can Momoko forget about me...

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.700
At this rate, we can't fulfill our promise...

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.000
You can't give up, Tenka.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.050
Becky!

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:34.070
Becky

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.670
Tenka, show it to her again.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.750
The promise between the two of you that was written on my body.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:45.750
I'm sure she'll remember it, the promise.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:48.130
You are right, Becky.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.400
Thank you, Becky.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.160
I'll go talk to Momoko again.

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:56.950
I'm sure your love will be answered.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.670
Because you are such a nice guy.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:03.500
That's my Becky, you are a good woman too.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.860
Please be my partner forever and ever.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.100
What's with that guy, he's talking to a soccer ball.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.250
It's so creepy.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.810
Becky, you are the best!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.290
What an unapproachable sight.

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:15.410
I can't go home like this.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.040
Inuzuka-kun!

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.760
Here is your notebook.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.160
Thank you.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.150
Su... Sure.

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:27.470
Good bye.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.260
Se... See you.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:32.140
You guys sure get along.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:34.460
What's this notebook!?

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:38.170
Could it be that you guys are exchanging diaries?

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.810
It's just my notes from the politics and economics class.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:40.890
Give it back to me already.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:42.200
No!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.560
Give it back!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.030
No, Koushi-dono, you can't, not here...

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:48.390
It's Momoko's voice.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.750
Good luck, Tenka.

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:52.270
Momoko!

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.690
What are you doing, you bastard?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:01.090
Get your dirty hands off of Momoko, you pervert!

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.050
No, you got it wrong.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.320
I'm not doing anything shameful.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:05.980
Right?

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:06.820
Oh, yeah.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.180
It's all my fault.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:13.840
My soul and body all belong to Koushi-dono, yet I didn't obey him.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.780
So I deserve any kind of punishment he gives me.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.110
What did you say!?

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.940
Don't make an ambiguous statement like that!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:25.100
Momoko, what's your relationship with Inuzuka Koushi!?

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.300
Tha... That's...

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:28.800
That's...

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:32.470
We are living together and fated for marriage.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.830
Fated for marriage... Living together...
Fated for marriage... Living together...
Fated for marriage... Living together...

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:38.900
Why you little...!?

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.160
You told me not to be ambiguous...

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:46.050
Unforgivable... Treating Momoko like that...

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.420
On top of that, he's gonna rob her of her freedom...

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.830
I won't let that happen!

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:56.570
A worm like you does not deserve Momoko!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:58.980
Duel with me, with Momoko at stake!

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:03.010
Shit, the situation just took a turn for the worse.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.710
What do I do...?

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:07.510
I can't seriously be thinking of fighting with this guy.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:08.930
If it comes to this...

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.160
Bring it on!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.000
Otherwise, here I come!

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:14.470
You coward!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:18.590
Haven't I told you I can't do martial arts?

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.010
You have an overwhelming advantage at a fight.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.670
This is called unfair!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.750
Do you duel with someone who hates noodles at a noodle eating contest?

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:29.210
And do you duel with someone who can't swim at a swimming contest?

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:32.850
Your duel is the same as those!

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.930
Then what do you want to duel me with?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.490
The thing you've been holding preciously, is it just a decoration?

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:40.340
Huh?

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.050
It's not a decoration!

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:44.790
No one has ever won me!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:48.490
What a coincidence, neither have I lost to anyone.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.090
Then fair and square...

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:53.460
Let's duel with soccer!

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.700
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:05.640
We will settle this with penalty kicks.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.440
The first one who scores three points wins.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:08.670
I'll let you go first.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:10.190
Great.

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:14.020
To fulfill my promise with Momoko-dono, I'll win for sure!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:21.750
This is good. With soccer, I don't have to worry about getting hurt even if I have to lose.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.960
On top of that, this could be a great chance to rid myself of my troubles.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.690
Take this!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:35.590
Huh?

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:42.030
This is not about getting hurt... I might die!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.640
Sis, did you see that?

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:48.680
Yeah. Unmistakable, that man...

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:51.600
He's from the clan that has the strength to rival the Kuzuryuu clan...

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:52.910
The Koganei clan.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.960
He's the third oldest among his brothers.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.030
What do we do, sis?

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:00.940
Let's just observe for now.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:04.410
This is a great chance to find out about Inuzuka Koushi's true strength.

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:05.080
Yes.

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:06.430
Hey.

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.190
Just to let you know, our lives are a part of the wager.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:09.840
Eh?

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.430
Well, of course.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.710
This is a fight between men with the woman they love at stake.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:19.060
The loser will have to disembowel himself, by seppuku!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:19.060
Note: Seppuku is a Japanese ritual suicide.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.350
I spoke too soon...

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.210
At this rate, I'll...

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.230
Even if I survive the match...

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.150
You gotta be kidding...

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.650
Wa... Wait... At a time like this, her strength...

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.680
Uh...

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:39.920
Please use this.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.620
Try to feel the atmosphere, will ya?

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.840
Hey, Momoko, me too, me too!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.180
And here's some replenishment!

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:51.490
By the way, use your technique...

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.260
Oh, rest assured.

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:56.740
I will not interfere with a duel between men!

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:00.140
Besides, I believe Koushi-dono will win.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.590
Shit, I guess I can't rely on her this time.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:04.950
Wait...

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.900
Here you go.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:09.890
Momoko, you are giving it to me, but not to Inuzuka Koushi?

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:13.940
Hmm... It looks like she likes you more than me.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.430
You guys look great together.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.190
I shouldn't even be here, see ya.

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.280
Really? See you~

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.320
It doesn't sound like a bad plan.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.120
Don't cry, Tenka.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.530
Hey, give the water to him.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:29.190
Huh? Why?

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.330
That's called "sportsmanship".

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:34.660
I see! Sportsmanship!

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.320
As I would expect...

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.720
Here you go.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:38.550
Huh?

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.140
N... No thanks!

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.430
Wh... Why...?

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.250
Le... Let's hurry up and get on with it!

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:50.280
I'm doomed... All he's thinking about is to duel with me.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.530
It's your turn to kick next!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.810
Shit. I hate to say it but I can't defend against his attacks.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:01.780
If this is the case...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.570
I'll have to crush his defense!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.580
With that big body of yours, you can't move swiftly!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:08.860
How naive.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.210
My clan is the tiger clan.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.370
We never let go of our preys.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.470
Ho... How could this happen...?

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:21.350
Neither my defense...

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:23.350
...nor my attack...

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.380
...can match him.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.700
O... Onii-chan is in danger!

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.900
You are the one who's in danger!

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.310
Just one more point...

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.960
It would be your loss with just one more point.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:44.810
Do you prefer to die with your stomach in two halves, or do you prefer to get smashed into pieces with this ball?

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.080
This guy is seriously thinking about killing me...

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.090
I can't die at a place like this!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.090
At a place like this...

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.830
What's wrong? Don't keep your mouth shut.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.340
If you got something to say, say it already!

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:06.200
By the way, are you scared of me?

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.920
How pitiful. You call yourself a man?

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.520
Not only you are weak, you are also a wimp.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:16.940
Shit...

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:20.420
This is the same as the time when the delinquents told me to do their homework...

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:23.750
What's this? Is he shivering?

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:24.970
Get it over with already.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:29.000
Inuzuka Koushi is so pathetic.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:31.940
Shivering in front of me like that.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:34.010
Like a straw that turns by the wind...

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:36.700
Koushi-dono is not that kind of person!

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.810
Momoko, open your eyes already.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.300
Look at him, he's peeing his pants.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.410
You are wrong!

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:51.370
Hey, kneel down.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.250
And say "I'm sorry, please forgive me".

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:55.310
No way...

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:56.620
How despicable!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.480
Sis...!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:02.300
Hey, hurry up and kneel down!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:09.410
Are you listening to me?

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:12.010
You are gonna obey my orders.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:17.500
So I never had any other choice but to kneel down against a guy as strong as him.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.520
Is this my only choice...?

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:23.740
Hurry.

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:38.160
What are you doing?

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:38.980
Let go.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.970
Please, don't.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:45.010
This is my only choice.

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:46.510
But...

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:47.840
But what!?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.690
Please, please try to imagine.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:56.510
At the moment when your knees touch the ground...

00:17:56.670 --> 00:18:01.660
Something precious in you would disappear.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.500
At the thought of that, I can't let go of my hands no matter what.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.420
That's why I will never let go.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:09.510
Never.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:10.520
Never.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.150
Never!

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.190
That's right...

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.530
If I bend my knees here.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.400
I would repeat the same thing countless times in the future.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:24.250
Shit! Dammit!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.530
I can't allow myself to be like that!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:27.930
Let's do this!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:29.540
Koushi-dono...

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:30.710
Inuzuka-kun!

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:32.440
Go for it!

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:35.730
Go for it, go for it, onii-chan~!

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.670
Sis...!

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.540
You got your nerve back?

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:38.880
Of course.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.530
I got no other choice.

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.350
But, think...

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:44.530
A way to defeat this guy...

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:45.800
Really.

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:49.920
Then get blown into pieces by my shot.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:51.800
Think!

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.440
How do I stop this ball...?

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:55.850
My clan is the tiger clan.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:19:00.570
A shot with the power of a tiger, you are gonna turn into smithereens!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.040
Talk more!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:03.690
I need more time to think!

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.460
Don't you feel honored?

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:08.220
You are gonna die in the hands of a tiger warrior.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.410
Tiger, tiger, you are getting on my nerves!

00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:11.610
Tigers are only...

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:14.530
I got it!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:15.170
Time out.

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.260
Hey, wait up!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.120
Come at me from any direction.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:23.910
Plastic bottles?

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.610
What's he thinking?

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:27.610
Don't take me for a fool!

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:28.720
Here I come!

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:37.800
Note: These are called nekoyoke, and are placed in Japanese neighborhoods to drive away cats.

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:37.800
Cats hate clear water bottles.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.990
I'm not a cat!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:42.720
Tigers and cats are in the same family.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:49.560
And from your behaviors, it's obvious that you have cats' habits!

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:55.810
Which means, a cat's weakness, is also your weakness!

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:00.990
I guess this is my major turning point.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:02.900
I won't let you!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:05.330
I'm gonna win, and fulfill my promise with Momoko!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:08.530
What does that "ke" mean?

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.020
With Momoko at stake, I won't let you take advantage of my weaknesses!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.260
Catnip!

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.690
He's totally taking advantage of it.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.910
It looks like you are the one who would have to cut himself open.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.060
Sh... Shit! How could this happen!

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:30.700
His defense...

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.190
His attack...

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:35.580
I can't beat him!

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:36.870
Oops, a kiwifruit.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.950
The match ends here!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.000
Koushi-dono~!

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.950
As I would expect! You did great!

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:54.710
I won with my brain.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.060
Thank goodness, Inuzuka-kun.

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:00.490
You did it! Onii-chan, you are great!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.980
Sis...!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.470
Shit, I lost.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:11.940
As promised, I'll commit seppuku!

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:15.410
You...

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:19.690
Seppuku was abolished in the year Meiji 6.

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:19.690
Note: Meiji 6 is the year 1873.

00:21:27.670 --> 00:21:29.260
I am completely defeated...

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:31.150
At everything...

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:35.290
Moreover, there are a lot of things I want to ask you.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.720
Why did you try to kill me?

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:41.130
And what exactly is the twelve shinshou war!? Tell me!

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.890
The twelve shinshou war...

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:44.920
That's...

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:46.790
That's...!

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:17.200
You are unconcerned even when my adoration for you has been shaken.

